      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Members of Parliament (Remuneration)(Amendment) Bill 2007"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/40/eng@/~cl_1",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/40/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/40/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/40/eng@"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/40/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/40/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act may be cited as the Members of Parliament (Remuneration) (Amendment) Act 2007."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/40/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/40/eng@/~cl_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This Act is deemed to have come into operation on 1 January 2007. Amendment of section 4"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/40/eng@/~cl_2",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/40/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/40/eng@/~cl_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/40/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Members of Parliament (Remuneration) Act 1980 [Act 237], which is referred to as the \"principal Act\" in this Act, is amended in section 4—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/40/eng@/~cl_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/40/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraphs (a) and (b), by substituting for the words \"fourteen thousand two hundred and nineteen ringgit and ninety-two sen\" the words \"fourteen thousand nine hundred and seven ringgit and twenty sen\"; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/40/eng@/~cl_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/40/eng@/~cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "in paragraphs (c) and (d), by substituting for the words \"nine thousand six hundred and eighty ringgit\" the words \"ten thousand eight hundred and forty-seven ringgit and sixty-five sen\". Payment of salaries notwithstanding section 7"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/40/eng@/~cl_3",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/40/eng@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Notwithstanding section 7 of the principal Act, the monthly salaries specified in the amendments to the principal Act in section 4, and payable, shall commence from 1 January 2007 or from the date of appointment or election, whichever is the later, of the President or Deputy President of the Senate and the Speaker or Deputy Speakers of the House of Representatives, as the case may be."
      }
    }
  ]
}
